1
00:00:00,967 --> 00:00:04,104
First, select the “CTA Canvas”

2
00:00:04,104 --> 00:00:06,539
Create “Hotspot Area” and set it as “Link To Block”

3
00:00:06,539 --> 00:00:11,211
You can adjust the “Display Setting” & “Activation Method”

4
00:00:11,211 --> 00:00:15,348
You can decide how this feature to be displayed

5
00:00:15,348 --> 00:00:21,521
You can add shadow and stroke of your display as well

6
00:00:21,521 --> 00:00:25,959
Select the linking block from one of your projects

7
00:00:25,959 --> 00:00:32,732
Then select the specific block that you would like to link with

8
00:00:34,267 --> 00:00:39,272
In preview, your linked block will show in display window
